Parsing -- a framework for building parsers
*******************************************

Description
===========

*note Parsing: Top, is a package the provides a framework for building parsers.
It introduces *note Parser: Parser,, a type of function that parses a sequence
of tokens, and *note Analyzer: Analyzer,, a type of function that accepts input
for the parser in its original form and separates it into a stream of tokens.
A parser can be combined with an analyzer: see *note Parser _colon_ Analyzer:
Parser _co Analyzer,, to produce a complete system for accepting input and
parsing it.

See the package *note Classic: (Classic)Top, for a good example of  the use of
this framework.

* Menu:

* Analyzer::                    the class of all lexical analyzers
* Parser::                      the class of all parsers
* Parser _colon_ Analyzer: Parser _co Analyzer.  combine a parser with a lexical analyzer to make a complete system

Author
======

  * Daniel R. Grayson (see http://www.math.uiuc.edu/~dan/ ) <dan@math.uiuc.edu>

