futureParser -- forward reference to a parser not defined yet
*************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        futureParser p
  * Inputs:
      * p, a *note symbol: (Macaulay2Doc)Symbol,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note parser: Parser,, a parser that will pass its input to the value
        of the symbol p at that time

Description
===========

This function makes recursive parsers possible.

+--------------------------+
|i1 : p = futureParser q   |
|                          |
|o1 = p                    |
|                          |
|o1 : Parser               |
+--------------------------+
|i2 : m = p : charAnalyzer |
|                          |
|o2 = m                    |
|                          |
|o2 : FunctionClosure      |
+--------------------------+
|i3 : q = constParser "abc"|
|                          |
|o3 = q                    |
|                          |
|o3 : Parser               |
+--------------------------+
|i4 : m "abc"              |
|                          |
|o4 = abc                  |
+--------------------------+

Code
====

