Function % Parser -- transform the value returned by a parser
*************************************************************

  * Operator: *note %: (Macaulay2Doc)%,
  * Usage: 
        f % p
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note function: (Macaulay2Doc)Function,
      * p, a *note parser: Parser,
  * Outputs:
      * a *note parser: Parser,, a parser that feeds its tokens to p and
        filters the value returned by p through f

Description
===========

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : (* constParser "abc" : charAnalyzer) "abcabcabc"                        |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = (abc, abc, abc)                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : Sequence                                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : (concatenate % * constParser "abc" : charAnalyzer) "abcabcabc"          |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = abcabcabc                                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : (constParser "abc" : charAnalyzer) "abc"                                |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = abc                                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : ((s -> concatenate("[",s,"]")) % constParser "abc" : charAnalyzer) "abc"|
|                                                                             |
|o4 = [abc]                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

